      "unresolved": [
        "Natural scheduling into the typed origin 869 is not established: what schedules GROUND.MES into 26M.MES and this guard is not measured -- the only record naming 26M is in GROUND's opaque tail; this is the second rung, reached when C01's guard rejected.",
        "The guard admits two disjoint clock slots (14:00..14:30 and 17:30..17:59); the caller's prefix picks a prelude by the slot at its own gap branch 982, and both slots are declared through variants here (the 17:30 slot as clock-1730 / clock-1759), but what else distinguishes the two slots beyond that prelude is not established.",
        "What sets global_u8[396] is not established.",
